{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C/C++ Header File", "description": "This header file defines the API and class for managing and retrieving throughput statistics for the MoCA ( Multimedia over Coax Alliance) interface in a TR-069 device management context. It includes class declarations, member functions for fetching statistical data such as bytes sent/received, packet errors, multicast/broadcast packets, and function documentation for external interaction.", "external_files": ["hostIf_main.h", "hostIf_tr69ReqHandler.h", "hostIf_utils.h", "Device_MoCA_Interface.h"], "external_methods": ["get_BytesSent", "get_BytesReceived", "get_PacketsSent", "get_PacketsReceived", "get_ErrorsSent", "get_ErrorsReceived", "get_UnicastPacketsSent", "get_UnicastPacketsReceived", "get_DiscardPacketsSent", "get_DiscardPacketsReceived", "get_MulticastPacketsSent", "get_MulticastPacketsReceived", "get_BroadcastPacketsSent", "get_BroadcastPacketsReceived", "get_UnknownProtoPacketsReceived"], "published": ["MoCAInterfaceStats"], "classes": [{"name": "MoCAInterfaceStats", "description": "A singleton class that provides methods to retrieve various throughput statistics (bytes, packets, errors, multicast, broadcast, unknown protocols) for the MoCA interface in a TR-069 managed device."}], "methods": [{"name": "get_BytesSent", "description": "Fetches the total number of bytes transmitted out of the MoCA interface, including framing characters."}, {"name": "get_BytesReceived", "description": "Fetches the total number of bytes received on the MoCA interface."}, {"name": "get_PacketsSent", "description": "Fetches the total number of packets transmitted out of the MoCA interface."}, {"name": "get_PacketsReceived", "description": "Fetches the total number of packets received on the MoCA interface."}, {"name": "get_ErrorsSent", "description": "Fetches the total number of outbound packets that could not be transmitted because of errors."}, {"name": "get_ErrorsReceived", "description": "Fetches the t